 <h3><u>Abbas naam hai mera</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>yabnaz zahra yaa abbas..(2)</p> 
  <p>mai ain se hussain ka aashiq bhi ishq bhi<br> be se hu buturab ki mai hasrate bhi<br> zahir alif se hai abu talib ki aa gahi<br> aur seen se hasan ki samaj bujh sath bhi</p> 
  <p>abbas dekhne mei faqad mera naam hai<br> darasl yeh hussain ke lashkar ka naam hai</p> 
  <p>abbas naam hai mera..(3)</p> 
  <p>maanga hai rab se maalike kaunain ne mujhe<br> beta kaha hai maadar e hasnain ne mujhe</p> 
  <p>1. asma e panjetan ka asasa hai mera naam<br> alfaz hai tawaaf me kaaba hai mera naam<br> israar aur ramuz ki duniya hai mera naam<br> khud mustafa ki beti ne mera naam<br> bejaan nahi hai harf koi mere naam me<br> simti hui hai naade ali mere naam me</p> 
  <p>2. tauheed ko hai naaz khudae wafa hu mai<br> mushkil kusha ka laal hu mushkil kusha hu mai<br> barso jabeen e shere khuda me raha hu mai<br> dohraya jab ali ko khuda ne bana hu mai<br> khilqat mei meri dakhl nahi maao teen ko<br> tohfa hu mai batul ka ummul banin ko</p> 
  <p>3. qehre khuda ki bolti tasweer meri tegh<br> rooho pe maut karti hai tehreer meri tegh<br> tegho me misle aaya e tatheer meri tegh<br> toofaane nuh khwaab hai taabeer meri tegh<br> ismat ki pehredaar hai tatheer ki qasam<br> yeh choti zulfiqar hai shabbir ki qasam</p> 
  <p>4. talwar meri jaaegi ran me jidhar jidhar<br> baarish waha pe hogi saro ki sarar sarar<br> ashal k paav peesege tumko karar karar<br> dekhegi maut khud yeh nazaare tukar tukar<br> san san ki saut aisi sama'at me chaegi<br> dhad dhad girege dhad na sada tumko aaegi</p> 
  <p>5. mai chahta hu quwat e baazu pe jang ho<br> dekhu to tumko kitney bahadur ho shamiyo<br> manzur yeh nahi hai to khud faisla karo<br> dikhlau maujizat mai apne jo tum kaho<br> darya pe haath dhoge abhi tum hayaat se<br> apne saro ko kaatoge khud apne haath se</p> 
  <p>6. aise karunga waar sambhal ne na dunga mai<br> pehlu bhi tumko aaj badalne na dunga mai<br> talwaar kya zabaan bhi chalne na dunga mai<br> nazro ke daaere se nikalne na dunga mai<br> meri hai kaaenaat kaha bachke jaaoge<br> sunlo jaha chipogey waha mujhko paaoge</p> 
  <p>7. tumko ghamand fauj pe qasrat pe hai gurur<br> in baazuo ke zor ka tumko nahi shauur<br> pal me nikaal dungaa mai zehno ka har futoor<br> dozakh ka naam aaj se hoga yazidpur<br> hum kehke yaa ali jo abhi tegh uthaege<br> murde tumhaare zere kafan thar tharaaege</p> 
  <p>8. mashur hai yeh baat khuda ki khudaai me<br> maahir hai meri tegh safo ki safaai me<br> tum kya mai do jahaan dubo du taraai me<br> daste khuda ka zor hai meri kalaai me<br> chahu toh baithe baithe mai ash'al ki zeen par<br> lehra ke aasmaan ko ulat du zameen par<br> &nbsp;<br> 9. aalam tha tera saal me aisa jalaal ka<br> siffin me badal diya naksha jidaal ka<br> ab toh shabaab aaya hai mere kamaal ka<br> abbas aaj ho gaya battees(32) saal kaa..(2)<br> sun lo qaza ke ghaat utaaruga mai tumhe<br> ghera hai tumne gher ke maarungaa mai tumhe</p> 
  <p>10. dunya na samjhi mir takallum yeh falsafa<br> parcham hai surkh gumbade ibne batul ka<br> yaani ruki nahi hai abhi jange karbala<br> aur aa rahi hai roza e abbas se sada<br> rokega mujhko tab na nawaasa rasool ka<br> mehdi ke saath loonga mai badlaa batool ka</p> 
  <p></p> 
